            "review_title": "Review at Tay Do Restaurant",
            "review_text": "buckwheat3693\nPortland, Oregon2 contributions\n0\nPleasant Surprise\nJul 2016 • Friends\nI have been traveling in Vietnam and Cambodia for two weeks, trying pho, fried noodles and rice, banh mi, etc. Tay Do specializes in cuisine from southwest Vietnam and they do it very well. The chef even came out and helped instruct us in the best way to eat the Vietnamese pancake we ordered. The restaurant is clean and tastefully decorated. Well worth a visit next time you're in Hanoi!\nRead more\nWritten July 2, 2016",
